From: CoWave Fall <105500745+CoWave-Fall@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] hog: enable notifications when the CCC read fails

Some HID devices reject reads of the CCC descriptor. Write the CCC value
and keep the notification subscription so the uhid input device is created.

Signed-off-by: CoWave Fall <105500745+CoWave-Fall@users.noreply.github.com>

--- a/profiles/input/hog-lib.c
+++ b/profiles/input/hog-lib.c
@@ -400,6 +400,13 @@
 	struct report *report = req->user_data;

 	if (status != 0) {
-		error("Error reading CCC value: %s", att_ecode2str(status));
+		/* 部分 HID 设备的 CCC 描述符拒绝读取，此时仍需写入以启用通知，
+		 * 否则报表订阅不会注册，uhid 输入设备也不会创建。
+		 */
+		error("Error reading CCC value: %s, enabling anyway",
+							att_ecode2str(status));
+		write_ccc(report->hog, report->hog->attrib, report->ccc_handle,
+									report);
+		status = 0;
 		goto remove;
 	}
